        "type": "h2",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "Notes from the reading room",
            "color": "#0b5394"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "This month we read three short novels set in winter. Each one is under two hundred pages, and each one is about a small community waiting for the thaw.",
            "color": "#222222"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "The group liked the second one best: a lighthouse keeper, a storm, and a stranger who arrives with nothing but a box of letters.",
            "color": "#222222"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "img",
        "image": 0
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "The reading room in January, before the heating was fixed.",
            "color": "#666666"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "h2",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "Next month",
            "color": "#0b5394"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "We turn to essays: a collection about walking in cities, chosen by Priya. Copies are on the shelf by the door.",
            "color": "#222222"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "We meet on the first Thursday at seven. Bring a friend, and a mug.",
            "color": "#222222"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "p",
        "inlines": [
          {
            "text": "The Reading Room · 4 Example Row · Sampletown",
            "scale": 0.8
          }
        ]
      },
